  "refinements": [
    "One cooperative native cohort uses a serial service mutex, persistent actionable predicate and private sole-drainer pipe; async signal bridge excluded pending its own law",
    "Notification debt and stable WakeLease accompany state publication; bounded drain precedes final locked check; no drain occurs between false check and OS wait",
    "No-missed-reason argument is conditional on backend token retention and live notifier; fatal wake failure and arbitrary EAGAIN interpretation do not prove progress",
    "Preaccept abort, acceptance and observer delivery have explicit serialized cuts; accepted custody survives cancellation and lost response",
    "Raw foreign field consumers and old wrapper invalidation need actual authority migration rather than a queue beneath unchanged observations",
    "Identity ledger includes root/discovery permits, reserved/queued/executing/waiting/publication/retained jobs, notification debts and physical dependencies",
    "Children reserve counted custody before construction/publication and parent completion; empty queue alone is not a drain cut",
    "Remaining foreign still-object teardown is a producer beyond final tracing GC; cleanup_rc frees remaining headers regardless of refcount, requiring real storage drain/transfer",
    "Eleven matched support rows, six change events and five economic conditions credit current C helpers/generation/donor transfer; lexical cleanup is a local candidate, not a positive aggregate bound"
  ],
